"letter"
"My dear brother Serge,


Long have I missed you and our family.  Please let them know that I'm still

alive.  I have been captured by a powerful band of ogres during an expedition

to Tarik Nor.  They have imprisoned and tortured me for many years in hopes

that I might teach them my knowledge of frenzying during battle.  I have

refused, and I think that is the only reason I'm still alive.  I am too weak

to return to you now, however, and wish to warn you of imminent danger.  These

ogres seek to dominate the world and one day our Khedrun nation.  You must

train and prepare all our fellow clansmen in order to protect our precious

homelands.


Forever your loving brother,

Tarnak Braveaxe

"
