"bylaws"
"In all correspondence, create an order in the logbook and always sign your

letters as being from Areadle's Fine Clothing By Mail.


Ex: Sincerely, Phule, CEO, Areadle's Fine Clothing By Mail


Always respond with their order number and ask that they use their order

number in correspondence.  Each item will receive an order number, so a single

mail could require more than one order number.


Possible status:

@I Inquiry received : information request, not a formal order

@I Inquiry responded : information request responded to

@I Order received : formal order received

@I Order responded : there were questions

@I Order rejected : Areadle rejected the order

@I Pending Agreement : order requirements sent for agreement

@I Order accepted : order has been agreed to and work is progressing

@I Order cancelled

@I Ready for delivery

@I Order complete : order has been delivered and accepted


Phule, CEO, Areadle's Fine Clothing By Mail

"
E
"#5"
"Status: Rejected

Reason: Areadle is not a jeweler

Requested by: Talarian

Object: a special engagement ring

"
