"A great, ogre-sized suit of thick, black iron plate armor.  The armor is

vastly thicker iron than could possibly be worn by someone of that size,

probably weighing in excess of three hundred pounds.  In particular, the

cuirass is nearly an inch thick both in front and back.  Despite the

overwhelming weight, the suit appears to have been scratched and battered in

places as if it had been worn in combat.  The cold iron armor is unordinary

except for its great size and unornamented simplicity.

