sky, seas boil, rivers rage beyond their banks.  The destruction spans worlds

as the speed of the images increases, hundreds of creatures both alien and

more familiar contorted in pain or lie dead.  As you move your hand away, you

feel a tangible longing from the book and you know in your mind that the book

is conscious and that it wants to be opened.  @n

